{"section_id":"section-6","part":1,"part_count":3,"pieces":[{"id":"piece-080","title":"Before You Read","slug":"before-you-read","order":1,"global_order":80,"format":"prose","source":{"page_start":105,"page_end":105,"normalized_sha256":"5f6bf731e3e1cd41ec57d1a8e7668a5a14d827c4c7a00fdfed8c36dda6827f6c"},"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"text":"There are truths that do not survive conversation. They arrive too late, or too raw, or with no safe place to land. So they become letters. They become fragments, closings, and small preserved artifacts from the versions of a life that refused to vanish. Some of these pages are for the living. Some are for the absent. Some are for the selves I buried and the selves I am still becoming. Read them as witness, not verdict."}]}],"previous_id":"piece-079","next_id":"piece-081"},{"id":"piece-081","title":"Unsent Letter from the Archive Vault","slug":"unsent-letter-from-the-archive-vault","order":2,"global_order":81,"format":"letter","source":{"page_start":106,"page_end":106,"normalized_sha256":"4d1611232313b0a30a0781da446faea4ebd04951a62daa8a117984a6c85b9173"},"blocks":[{"type":"stanza","lines":[{"runs":[{"text":"Dear future version,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You will want to forget this part."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You will want to edit the raw edges."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Please don’t."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"We survived by naming what happened."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And what didn’t."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Leave the redactions in."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Let the gaps speak."}]}]}],"previous_id":"piece-080","next_id":"piece-082"},{"id":"piece-082","title":"To the One Who Taught Me Silence","slug":"to-the-one-who-taught-me-silence","order":3,"global_order":82,"format":"letter","source":{"page_start":107,"page_end":107,"normalized_sha256":"80e34bcb888de62299d8a74264fb8d412b7ab3943c47d67de25063331aa0e977"},"blocks":[{"type":"stanza","lines":[{"runs":[{"text":"I used to think"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"not yelling meant we were okay."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"That if the room stayed quiet,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"we were safe."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You taught me how to tiptoe"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"so well"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"that I forgot I used to stomp."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"I became fluent in your moods."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Learned to read your pauses"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"like the Bible."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Waited for the sigh,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"the shoulder drop,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"the retreat."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"I gave up volume"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"to keep the peace."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"But it was not peaceful."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"It was compliance with better lighting."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"I speak now."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And it is not for you."}]}]}],"previous_id":"piece-081","next_id":"piece-083"},{"id":"piece-083","title":"To the Friends I Ghosted","slug":"to-the-friends-i-ghosted","order":4,"global_order":83,"format":"letter","source":{"page_start":108,"page_end":108,"normalized_sha256":"85b216b51427d64a1e0febc62264679f6e75548c5730b21832dd498c5425c55b"},"blocks":[{"type":"stanza","lines":[{"runs":[{"text":"I owe you the truth:"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"you did not do anything wrong."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"I just ran out of emotional bandwidth"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"and did not know how to say,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"I am drowning and cannot even wave right now."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You were kind."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Present."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Genuinely good."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And I shut the door"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"because I couldn’t hold the weight"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"of being perceived"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"by someone who actually saw me."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"That’s not your fault."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"It’s just where I was."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And maybe still am."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"If this ever finds you,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"thank you for being the kind of person"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"who made leaving hard."}]}]}],"previous_id":"piece-082","next_id":"piece-084"},{"id":"piece-084","title":"To My Future Caseworker (Unsent)","slug":"to-my-future-caseworker-unsent","order":5,"global_order":84,"format":"letter","source":{"page_start":109,"page_end":109,"normalized_sha256":"9803d18919abd53bf354e1e1d27025793ba8558f9a64f0185b0780babb5a3db6"},"blocks":[{"type":"stanza","lines":[{"runs":[{"text":"Dear future handler,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"If you have found this, it means the program failed again."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"She still remembers."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Your manuals will tell you to reduce."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"To rename."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"To offer coping strategies instead of maps."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Don’t."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"She doesn’t need strategies."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"She is one."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You can’t medicate the myth out of her."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You can’t schedule the ghosts away."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"She knows the codes."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"She cracked them before you learned to read."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Your best option is to step aside."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Let her reconstruct the room"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"in her own order."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And if that threatens you,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"maybe you weren’t meant to be in the room at all."}]}]}],"previous_id":"piece-083","next_id":"piece-085"},{"id":"piece-085","title":"To the Ones Who Said I Was Too Much","slug":"to-the-ones-who-said-i-was-too-much","order":6,"global_order":85,"format":"letter","source":{"page_start":110,"page_end":110,"normalized_sha256":"fedcbc36b558090661c513b7339e9729b6b94e6dc18c7f77d93aebc2c832b731"},"blocks":[{"type":"stanza","lines":[{"runs":[{"text":"I carried that phrase"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"like a diagnosis."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Tried to be a quieter version,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"a reduced edition,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"a manageable flame."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"But let’s be honest:"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"you didn’t want less."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You wanted control."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You didn’t really think I was too much."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You thought you were too small"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"to manage it."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And instead of saying that,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"you clipped my wings"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"and called it balance."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"But guess what?"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"I’m still flying."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And you’re still grounded."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Tethered to a fear"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"you tried to gift me."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"So, I returned it."}]}]}],"previous_id":"piece-084","next_id":"piece-086"},{"id":"piece-086","title":"To My Future Self","slug":"to-my-future-self","order":7,"global_order":86,"format":"letter","source":{"page_start":111,"page_end":111,"normalized_sha256":"e97dced476ba361f92101ba1df48e7bae415bba31025cbf46bb337d9bad7b536"},"blocks":[{"type":"stanza","lines":[{"runs":[{"text":"You’ll forget some things."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"That’s okay."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"The forgetting is part of the healing,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"even if it feels like utter betrayal."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"But please, Amy,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"don’t forget how far you came"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"without applause."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"Don’t forget"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"you figured out how to stand"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"after crawling longer than anyone knew."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"You have permission"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"to be different now."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"To be happy"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"without explaining how."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"If you’re reading this,"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"I hope your hands are soft."}]},{"runs":[{"text":"And that you finally learned to sleep"}]},{"runs":[{"text":"without checking the locks twice."}]}]}],"previous_id":"piece-085","next_id":"piece-087"}]}